@startuml
class "Identity service" as Identity <<service>> [[https://example.com/identity]] #lightblue {
  + validate(token : String) : Principal
}
class "User store" as Store <<repository>> #lightyellow

Identity --> Store #blue [[https://example.com/persistence]] <<reads>> : looks up users

note right of Identity #pink
  Validates bearer tokens
  before user lookup.
end note

note on link #yellow : encrypted connection
@enduml
